+External egress is now role-aware and provider-neutral. Premium/default Council and Fusion work starts with direct DeepSeek, cheap/Shadow work starts with lower-cost routes, every valid provider key in `aura_secrets.json` is rotated, and unpinned calls fall through to the next configured provider. Fireworks remains a compatibility fallback rather than the primary route. See `docs/AURA_PROVIDER_ROUTING.md`.
